OL,3,GNEWSAWolves mural vandalised on derby
OL,4,Aday now restored
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn artist is hoping Wolverhampton
OL,7,FWanderers fans will now be able to
OL,8,Fenjoy his restored mural of past and
OL,9,Fpresent players after it was vandalised
OL,10,Fbefore last month's Black Country
OL,11,Fderby.
OL,13,FJoe Miles said he had just finished his
OL,14,Fartwork at the entrance of Molineux
OL,15,FSubway days before Wolves played West
OL,16,FBrom at home on 20 September, only for
OL,17,Fblue paint to be thrown at it.
OL,19,FThe 39-year-old has now brought it back
OL,20,Fto its former glory and is hoping fans
OL,21,Fand players "get hyped" by it, ahead of
OL,22,Ftheir next game at Molineux.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,360,350,200,160,0,100
