OL,3,GNEWSAWolves mural vandalised on derby
OL,4,Aday now restored
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn 18-year-old man arrested by West
OL,7,FMidlands Police investigating the
OL,8,Fdamage has since been released on bail,
OL,9,Fthe force said.
